{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bc83d592-644f-81fc-95a7-29eaeeb1285e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T13:23:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. My trash, it was not picked up this week. The usual day is Tuesday, and nobody came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look into that for you. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 29 Kay Street. In the Historic Hill, up near the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-nine Kay Street, got it. And you said Tuesday is your regular day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Tuesday. Always Tuesday. I put the barrel out Monday night, like always. Wednesday morning it is still full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Hang on one second while I pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. [pause] I can hear you typing, so I know you are working on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, yes, I'm typing. Keyboard's loud today. Okay, I see your street on the Tuesday route. Was it the trash only, or the recycling too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the trash. The recycling, that is every other week, so it is not this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that makes sense. Was your barrel out by the curb early in the morning? Sometimes the trucks come through earlier than people expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it was out since Monday night. By the curb, with the lid closed. No snow blocking it, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm going to put in a missed pickup report for 29 Kay Street. Usually they'll send a truck back within a day or two, depending on how many stops they missed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is there a fee for this? For the second pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no fee. A missed pickup is on us. You don't pay anything for them to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:21:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. So I understand correctly, I leave the barrel outside, and they come back, and I do not call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Leave it at the curb, and they'll pick it up. If it's still sitting there by Saturday, give us a call back and we'll follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Saturday. Okay. Is it better that I call this number again, or a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This number's fine. Just ask for Public Works. Do you want me to put a callback number on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the name on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yusuf Kim. Kim, K-I-M. Yusuf, Y-U-S-U-F."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mr. Kim. Report's in. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
